  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7007.08 Form of Payment. The form of payment for the surcharge revenue shall be by check made payable to the State of New Hampshire, department of safety, division of emergency services.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); renumbered by #11010 (from Saf-C 7007.07); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16",
